{"title": "try_files + alias 实测（1.31.5）", "lines": [
  {"t": "config", "s": "location /images/ { alias /data/uploads/;"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "  try_files $uri =404; }"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s localhost/images/logo.png"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "UPLOAD"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s localhost/images/nope.png"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "404 (open() \"/data/uploads//nope.png\" failed)"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "按前缀替换检查，双斜杠无害，旧版拼错路径的行为已修复"}
]}
